      "message": "[info] Line 589: This subscription is not added to `mDisposableBag`, unlike every other long-lived subscription in this class. While the `Completable` from `handleCallNotification` disposes itself on completion, an in-flight subscription won\u0027t be cancelled if the facade is torn down mid-emission, and it\u0027s inconsistent with the surrounding code. Wrap it for consistency and safe teardown:\n```suggestion\n        if (conference.participants.isEmpty() \u0026\u0026 conference.hostCall \u003d\u003d null) {\n            mDisposableBag.add(mNotificationService.handleCallNotification(conference, true)\n                .subscribe({}, { e -\u003e Log.e(TAG, \"Error removing call notification for conference ${conference.id}\", e) }))\n        }\n```",
